Third-party components
----------------------
The MG996R servos, ESP32-S3 board, MAX98357A amplifier, INMP441 microphone,
WS2812 ring, speaker and Cherry MX switch are third-party hardware. This
project models their dimensions in order to fit them; it does not
redistribute their designs, firmware or trademarks.
